  <h2>Packaging: Your Silent Brand Ambassador</h2>
  <p>In the direct-to-consumer (DTC) and premium B2B space, the packaging is the first physical interaction a customer has with your brand. A generic polybag can devalue a high-quality garment, while thoughtful packaging justifies a premium price point.</p>
  
  <h3>The "Luxury" Checklist</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Frosted Slider Bags:</strong> These are the industry standard for premium activewear. They are durable, water-resistant, and reusable, which adds value for the end customer.</li>
    <li><strong>Custom Hangtags:</strong> Move beyond basic cardstock. Consider soft-touch finishes, spot UV logos, or even recycled seed-paper tags that can be planted.</li>
    <li><strong>Silicon Branding:</strong> For a high-end feel, many of our clients are opting for silicon-printed logos directly on the slider bags.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Sustainability Wins</h3>
  <p>2026 is the year of "Zero Plastic." Fitclo offers 100% biodegradable and compostable shipping bags. By switching to eco-friendly packaging, you not only help the planet but also build deep loyalty with environmentally conscious consumers.</p>

  <h3>Customization at Fitclo</h3>
  <p>We provide full private-label packaging services. We can store your custom boxes, tags, and bags in our warehouse and use them for every order, ensuring a consistent brand experience across your entire product line.</p>
